        <mxCell id="biz1" value="&lt;div style='font-size:11px;'&gt;• Password hashing with bcrypt&lt;br&gt;• JWT token issued on register/login&lt;br&gt;• Token revoked on logout&lt;br&gt;• express-validator on all routes&lt;br&gt;• Relies on the User model (users module)&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#EBF5FB;strokeColor=#AED6F1;strokeWidth=1;align=left;spacingLeft=5;spacingRight=5;" vertex="1" parent="1">
